config LNET_SOCKLND
	tristate "TCP/IP socket LND (ksocklnd)"
	depends on LNET
	default LNET
	help
	  The socket LND (ksocklnd) carries LNet traffic over any
	  TCP/IP-capable network interface. It is the default LNet network
	  driver and requires no special hardware.

	  To compile this as a kernel module, choose M here and it will be
	  called ksocklnd.

	  If unsure, say Y.
